invariant: INV-55
file: handshake_post.c
catches: unit
reason: ch_read takes every KeyUpdate a peer sends, each a key
  derivation, with no limit on a run, so a peer can send KeyUpdates and
  no data at all. bin/unit requires the KeyUpdate after a full run to
  fail the read with CH_KEY_UPDATE_LIMIT.

--- old
    if (t->key_update_run >= CH_KEY_UPDATE_RUN_MAX) {
        return CH_KEY_UPDATE_LIMIT;
    }
--- new
